<title>USA: TENNIS-LIPTON CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LIPTON CHAMPIONSHIPS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KEY BISCYANE, Florida 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $4.45 million Lipton Championships tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarterfinals, men's singles</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Hendrik Dreekman (Germany) --</p>
<p>walkover. (Dreekman suffered a sprained ankle prior to the</p>
<p>match.)</p>
<p>Quarterfinal round women's single</p>
<p>3-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat 8-Iva Majoli (Croatia)</p>
<p>6-2 3-6 7-6 (9-7)</p>
</text>
